    "title": "Port steps back from Olympia Regional Airport's updated master plan process - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jerome Tuaño ,\n5 hours ago The Port of Olympia has decided not to continue the process for adopting the Olympia Regional Airport’s updated master plan, an official said. The master plan is a long-range planning document that describes how the airport is preparing for future demand. It includes proposed layouts that show reconfigured runways and taxiways, as well as areas designated for potential industrial, commercial, corporate and general aviation use. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
